I hate you.


01:05:38.667 --> 01:05:40.931
Very good. You look pretty.


01:05:41.103 --> 01:05:42.798
I know.


01:05:44.473 --> 01:05:47.306
That broad
ain't getting away with ruining your life.


01:05:47.476 --> 01:05:49.137
I'm pooping in her bed tonight.


01:05:49.311 --> 01:05:52.144
Victor, I thought you hated me.


01:05:52.314 --> 01:05:53.406
Are you an idiot?


01:05:53.582 --> 01:05:55.743
You're the only person
who knows my birthday.


01:05:55.917 --> 01:05:57.782
The only one who says goodnight
to me.


01:05:57.953 --> 01:06:00.353
The only one who makes me
mac and cheese.


01:06:00.522 --> 01:06:02.717
You're annoying and ugly...


01:06:02.891 --> 01:06:04.290
...but I sort of love you.


01:06:06.728 --> 01:06:08.355
I sort of love you too.


01:06:08.964 --> 01:06:13.424
But just promise me
you're not gonna do anything, okay?


01:06:13.902 --> 01:06:15.494
- You too.
- Oh, come on.


01:06:15.670 --> 01:06:17.604
- Just... No... Ple...
- Just... No. Just...


01:06:17.772 --> 01:06:19.262
- No. Tony.
- Just one...


01:06:20.175 --> 01:06:21.506
Okay.


01:06:21.776 --> 01:06:26.179
All right.
Well, now I get to go fold Bev's delicates.


01:06:41.696 --> 01:06:45.325
- Have you heard of knocking?
- Ever heard of I don't care?


01:06:45.600 --> 01:06:47.761
Where'd you put my blue blouse?


01:06:47.936 --> 01:06:50.029
Oh, okay.


01:06:50.205 --> 01:06:52.730
Okay, which one of these
do you like better?


01:06:53.642 --> 01:06:57.544
- You actually want my opinion?
- God, I know. What's wrong with me?


01:06:58.513 --> 01:07:02.415
You know how you're a bitch and I act
like I don't care, but truth is I'm sensitive?


01:07:02.584 --> 01:07:05.109
- Actually...
- I need someone to talk to like a sister...


01:07:05.287 --> 01:07:07.187
...and you're better than nothing.


01:07:08.657 --> 01:07:13.094
I'm nervous about tonight.
Oh, my God, why did I just tell you that?


01:07:14.963 --> 01:07:17.056
I don't know.


01:07:17.399 --> 01:07:19.663
It's like my whole body is freaking out.


01:07:19.834 --> 01:07:20.926
I have hives on my butt.


01:07:21.102 --> 01:07:23.570
I can't tell Mom
and I can't talk to Luke about it.


01:07:23.738 --> 01:07:25.103
He'll say something like:


01:07:25.273 --> 01:07:28.208
"Oh, one minute
you're talented and we're connecting...


01:07:28.376 --> 01:07:31.607
...and the next minute you're self-involved
and histrionic."


01:07:31.780 --> 01:07:35.011
- What does that even mean? I hate history.
- He said that?


01:07:36.851 --> 01:07:40.719
Listen, Toadie, he's not falling for you,
he's falling for me.


01:07:40.889 --> 01:07:42.584
I just don't know who me is anymore.


01:07:42.757 --> 01:07:45.055
Why are you nervous?
You're not really singing.


01:07:45.227 --> 01:07:48.287
All you have to do is stand there
and look pretty.


01:07:49.864 --> 01:07:52.697
Have you ever thought
about how that makes me feel?


01:07:53.501 --> 01:07:54.968
You have talent.


01:07:55.136 --> 01:07:58.628
<i>You could go on American Idol
and forget about the rest of us.</i>


01:07:58.873 --> 01:08:01.205
This is, like, my only chance.


01:08:01.910 --> 01:08:03.639
Pretty doesn't last very long.


01:08:03.812 --> 01:08:05.746
Just look at Mom.


01:08:07.916 --> 01:08:09.042
You think I'm talented?


01:08:10.852 --> 01:08:12.945
If you tell anyone I said that, I'll deny it.


01:08:14.656 --> 01:08:16.180
Wear the blue blouse.


01:08:16.358 --> 01:08:18.326
It makes your eyes pop.


01:08:21.429 --> 01:08:22.657
This better work.


01:08:23.231 --> 01:08:25.461
Because if I go down,
you're go down with me.


01:08:38.446 --> 01:08:42.109
Yeah, yeah, yeah.
What's up, my party people?


01:08:42.284 --> 01:08:45.378
Yeah. All right, all right, all right.
Let's get this show started.


01:08:45.553 --> 01:08:49.546
Welcome to the stage, my boy, my British
biscuit and y'all's host for the night...


01:08:49.724 --> 01:08:52.215
...Luke Morgan.


01:08:54.796 --> 01:08:57.788
Are you amped for the Wellesley Academy
of the Arts Showcase?


01:08:59.334 --> 01:09:03.430
Good. Because we have Mickey O'Malley
spinning tonight.


01:09:07.375 --> 01:09:13.439
So let's get this party started
with Big Pain Ticket.


01:09:23.191 --> 01:09:26.957
<i>I wanna kiss your apocalypse</i>


01:09:27.128 --> 01:09:30.222
<i>Wrap you in my Armageddon</i>


01:09:30.398 --> 01:09:33.890
<i>Sing you a twisted serenade</i>


01:09:34.069 --> 01:09:37.129
<i>We can run away together</i>


01:09:47.315 --> 01:09:50.045
Hello, Guy. So glad you could make it.


01:09:50.218 --> 01:09:53.244
My two A&R guys, Tom and, uh, Tom.


01:09:53.822 --> 01:09:55.187
Uh, did I miss your big line up?


01:09:55.357 --> 01:09:58.952
