- No. No.


01:10:59.020 --> 01:11:01.887
No? No? No? Then focus!


01:11:07.395 --> 01:11:10.057
- Look, Ange, you...
- Gail's been threatening me too.


01:11:10.231 --> 01:11:12.256
That's why you're doing
what she wants.


01:11:12.600 --> 01:11:14.898
