- Ange.


01:11:15.503 --> 01:11:17.437
You're my best friend.


01:11:17.605 --> 01:11:20.039
Look, I'd do anything for you.


01:11:30.518 --> 01:11:32.349
Okay.


01:11:34.589 --> 01:11:39.117
So we're gonna take it up a notch
with Jason Berkeley and the Funky Funk.


01:11:44.966 --> 01:11:45.990
Scratch that.


01:11:46.167 --> 01:11:49.102
Um, here are my boys, the Oral Majority.


01:11:57.812 --> 01:12:00.280
<i>I'm lost in a world that rattles my brain</i>


01:12:00.448 --> 01:12:04.350
<i>Cleaning up my life
From the mess you made, oh, oh</i>


01:12:07.155 --> 01:12:08.520
Move it. Guy.


01:12:08.690 --> 01:12:12.888
This is just the boring appetizer.
The real showstopper's up next.


01:12:13.061 --> 01:12:14.528
Ah!
Oh!


01:12:14.696 --> 01:12:17.563
You okay, Mr. Morgan?
Here, let me get that for you.


01:12:19.000 --> 01:12:20.194
Well, it had better be.


01:12:20.368 --> 01:12:21.596
I have to pee.


01:12:21.769 --> 01:12:25.000
Oh, I will take you to the pee, Mr. Victor.


01:12:27.942 --> 01:12:29.773
Sorry.


01:12:30.211 --> 01:12:32.736
<i>So keep on knocking, knocking, knocking</i>


01:12:32.914 --> 01:12:37.851
<i>But, baby, you're better off walking
'Cause I ain't gonna let you in</i>


01:12:38.586 --> 01:12:40.747
<i>Never again</i>


01:12:40.922 --> 01:12:43.982
<i>No, not again</i>


01:12:44.158 --> 01:12:46.524
<i>Never again</i>


01:12:46.694 --> 01:12:50.027
<i>No, not again</i>


01:12:54.836 --> 01:12:56.167
My brothers, yeah!


01:12:56.337 --> 01:12:57.736
Okay.


01:12:58.072 --> 01:13:00.233
You guys having a good time?


01:13:00.808 --> 01:13:05.211
