01:13:24.966 --> 01:13:27.059
<i>The feeling ignites</i>


01:13:27.235 --> 01:13:28.293
<i>I'm in control</i>


01:13:28.469 --> 01:13:32.565
<i>The crowd's in the palm of my hand
All my fans stand</i>


01:13:32.740 --> 01:13:36.176
<i>What is the truth?
What's an illusion?</i>


01:13:36.344 --> 01:13:40.041
<i>You're searching for proof
But are you certain?</i>


01:13:40.214 --> 01:13:43.775
<i>Whatever you see is what you get</i>


01:13:43.952 --> 01:13:47.752
<i>If words paint a picture
Then I bet you I can get you, yeah</i>


01:13:47.922 --> 01:13:52.154
<i>I'll make you believe in me</i>


01:13:52.327 --> 01:13:55.558
<i>I can be what you want me to be</i>


01:13:55.730 --> 01:13:59.166
<i>Tonight is the night
Where I'll make you see</i>


01:13:59.334 --> 01:14:03.031
<i>That I can be
Anything, anything, anything</i>


01:14:03.204 --> 01:14:07.607
<i>I'll make you believe in me</i>


01:14:07.775 --> 01:14:09.242
<i>I can be what you want...</i>


01:14:13.114 --> 01:14:14.138
Give me...


01:14:20.822 --> 01:14:24.918
I'm so sorry, my mike...
My mike isn't working.


01:14:25.326 --> 01:14:27.817
Uh, excuse me.


01:14:30.698 --> 01:14:32.825
<i>I don't know.
- Give me that. Give me that.</i>


01:14:38.039 --> 01:14:42.271
How dare you sabotage your mother,
