01:15:49.010 --> 01:15:51.376
<i>I'm breaking the rules</i>


01:15:51.546 --> 01:15:52.740
<i>Flow in the flow</i>


01:15:52.914 --> 01:15:56.873
<i>I got the whole world nodding, yes
Like some bobbleheads</i>


01:15:57.051 --> 01:15:58.416
<i>I'll break a sweat</i>


01:15:59.620 --> 01:16:00.644
<i>If you want it</i>


01:16:00.822 --> 01:16:02.949
<i>Confess all your sins</i>


01:16:03.124 --> 01:16:04.421
<i>You know you got 'em</i>


01:16:04.592 --> 01:16:06.856
<i>The room's in a spin</i>


01:16:07.028 --> 01:16:08.052
<i>The fever's pitched</i>


01:16:08.229 --> 01:16:10.197
- You gotta go. Come on, get out there.
Aah!


01:16:10.364 --> 01:16:12.161
<i>I'm legit, I'm no counterfeit</i>


01:16:12.333 --> 01:16:16.793
<i>I'll make you believe in me</i>


01:16:16.971 --> 01:16:19.735
<i>I can be what you want me to be</i>


01:16:19.907 --> 01:16:23.570
<i>Tonight is the night where I make you see</i>


01:16:23.745 --> 01:16:27.374
<i>That I can be
Anything, anything, anything</i>


01:16:27.548 --> 01:16:31.951
<i>I'll make you believe in me</i>


01:16:32.120 --> 01:16:33.314
<i>I can be what you want me to be</i>


01:16:33.488 --> 01:16:36.286
Hey! Shut that camera down! Now!


01:16:36.457 --> 01:16:38.925
<i>Tonight is the night where I make you see</i>


01:16:39.093 --> 01:16:42.995
<i>That I can be
Anything, anything, anything</i>


01:16:43.164 --> 01:16:45.257
<i>You want from me</i>


01:16:51.706 --> 01:16:53.503
That's what I'm talking about.


01:16:55.343 --> 01:16:57.834
Shut the power down. Shut it down.


01:17:00.982 --> 01:17:03.382
Not so fast, jerknuts.


01:17:06.687 --> 01:17:08.052
Hey. Clear.


01:17:11.159 --> 01:17:13.559
<i>Sing something else.
We want more! We want more!</i>


01:17:13.728 --> 01:17:15.025
Like what?


01:17:15.296 --> 01:17:17.161
The demo you snuck my dad. I heard it.


01:17:17.331 --> 01:17:19.128
Yeah, do it!
Do it!


01:17:19.300 --> 01:17:24.670
<i>We want more!
We want more! We want more!</i>


01:17:27.441 --> 01:17:29.409
Okay, follow my lead, guys.


01:17:37.118 --> 01:17:41.111
<i>There's a little secret
I would like to tell you</i>


01:17:44.225 --> 01:17:48.855
<i>There's a book of lies
I know they'll try to sell you</i>


01:17:50.097 --> 01:17:53.658
<i>And they'll try and they'll try
To convince you to buy</i>


01:17:53.835 --> 01:17:55.325
<i>You need them</i>


01:17:57.305 --> 01:18:00.741
<i>So the next time you're down
Look inside, not around</i>


01:18:00.908 --> 01:18:04.071
<i>I can dress myself</i>


01:18:04.245 --> 01:18:07.180
<i>There's no need for someone's help</i>


01:18:07.348 --> 01:18:08.975
<i>There's no one to blame</i>


01:18:09.150 --> 01:18:14.884
<i>There's no one to save you but yourself</i>


01:18:15.056 --> 01:18:18.355
<i>I can justify</i>


01:18:18.526 --> 01:18:21.495
<i>All the mistakes in my life</i>


01:18:21.662 --> 01:18:24.859
<i>It's taught me to be
It's given to me</i>


01:18:25.032 --> 01:18:27.432
<i>And I'll survive</i>


01:18:27.602 --> 01:18:30.730
<i>'Cause I have blessed myself</i>


01:18:32.206 --> 01:18:39.078
<i>Do you ever wonder
How anything can make you cry?</i>


01:18:39.247 --> 01:18:42.910
<i>Have yourself discover</i>


01:18:43.084 --> 01:18:50.081
<i>That the pain you feel
Is the pain that you deny</i>


01:18:50.258 --> 01:18:53.523
<i>You can bless yourself</i>


01:18:53.694 --> 01:18:56.595
<i>There's no need for someone else</i>


01:18:56.764 --> 01:19:04.193
<i>There's no one to blame
There's no one to save you but yourself</i>


01:19:04.372 --> 01:19:07.569
<i>I can justify</i>


01:19:07.742 --> 01:19:10.711
<i>All the mistakes in my life</i>


01:19:10.878 --> 01:19:13.972
<i>It's taught me to be
It's given to me</i>


01:19:14.148 --> 01:19:16.639
<i>And I'll survive</i>


01:19:16.817 --> 01:19:19.547
<i>'Cause I have blessed myself</i>


01:19:37.071 --> 01:19:38.732
Thank you, ladies and gentlemen.


01:19:38.906 --> 01:19:42.307
We hope you enjoyed the Wellesley
Academy of Arts Showcase.


01:19:42.476 --> 01:19:45.036
Oh, my God, you were so good.


01:19:45.413 --> 01:19:47.745
Who are you?
You're like a freaking rock star.


01:19:47.915 --> 01:19:50.008
Are you kidding me? Man, she likes you...


01:20:01.228 --> 01:20:04.163
So, what did he say? Is he mad?


01:20:04.332 --> 01:20:05.993
Yeah. He's pretty ticked off...


01:20:06.167 --> 01:20:09.933
...that I'm not already making
the next big album for Kensington Records.


01:20:11.906 --> 01:20:13.669
Oh. Which album?


01:20:14.575 --> 01:20:15.599
Your album.


01:20:17.278 --> 01:20:19.269
- Are you kidding me?
- No.


01:20:20.881 --> 01:20:23.349
- You're... You're serious?
- Uh-huh.


01:20:25.586 --> 01:20:26.917
Go for it.


01:20:27.088 --> 01:20:29.852
We're making an album.
And we're writing it together.


01:20:30.024 --> 01:20:32.083
Yeah! Yeah!
I'm so happy.


01:20:32.259 --> 01:20:34.056
You know, I sing too.


01:20:34.228 --> 01:20:37.857
I can do a whole monologue album.
Incredible. Hey, congratulations.


01:20:38.032 --> 01:20:42.560
- Yo, blow it up. Boom.
I'm your boy. Call me up.


01:20:42.737 --> 01:20:46.138
Yeah. Yeah, he's really good
at guitars. He's a kook.


