- Well, everyone lies in this business.


01:21:06.293 --> 01:21:07.317
It's called spin.


01:21:07.962 --> 01:21:09.327
So Bev can't sing.


01:21:09.497 --> 01:21:11.226
That didn't stop Jessica Simpson.


01:21:11.399 --> 01:21:14.994
Well, we'll see what the school board
thinks when I get them a ring, shall we?


01:21:15.369 --> 01:21:18.167
