01:21:22.476 --> 01:21:23.943
Guy!


01:21:25.279 --> 01:21:28.942
I will have my nirvana moment.


01:21:29.183 --> 01:21:32.949
<i>I'll make you believe in me</i>


01:21:34.422 --> 01:21:37.482
<i>I can be what you want me to be</i>


01:21:37.658 --> 01:21:40.252
Oh, come on. Look alive, people.
I'm a star.


01:21:40.428 --> 01:21:41.986
Let's try this again.


01:21:42.196 --> 01:21:44.061
<i>I'll make you believe...</i>


01:21:45.633 --> 01:21:48.363
Oh, no. You want a piece of me?


01:22:14.028 --> 01:22:16.258
Hey. Clear.


01:22:31.946 --> 01:22:34.107
<i>Run this town tonight</i>


01:22:34.281 --> 01:22:36.647
Where's breakfast...? Sorry.


01:23:18.526 --> 01:23:21.120
<i>I'm lost in a world
That rattles my brain</i>


01:23:21.295 --> 01:23:24.162
<i>I'm cleaning up my life
From the mess you made, oh, oh</i>


01:23:29.136 --> 01:23:32.663
- Katie, are you wearing a doormat?
- Welcome.


01:23:39.113 --> 01:23:41.172
Thanks. Now the pants.


01:23:46.353 --> 01:23:50.653
And then it would just take you somewhere
that you never expected you would go.


01:23:55.095 --> 01:23:58.087
<i>You wanna hear
the monologue from My Fair Lady?</i>


01:23:58.265 --> 01:24:00.392
Oy, mate, oy.


01:24:19.887 --> 01:24:21.752
I love my life.


01:24:21.922 --> 01:24:24.117
<i>Call me.
- Hello?</i>


01:24:46.580 --> 01:24:49.777
<i>Yeah. You like it? You like it? Yeah.</i>

